{"id": "draft-c10-02", "record_sha256": "2328f004d9d3a910b3627a61f149b3c2dbfa049edc4b0b31ee9f8f246b1e42a9", "math_sha256": "af5d432caae609113046d9415ca99a036317cea82eac4e29a7c860dfa5e74c21", "problem": "设$b_n=1/\\sqrt{n(n+1)}$，$a_n=b_n+(-1)^n/[n(n+1)]$。证明$a_n>0$、$a_n$不单调，且$\\sum_{n\\ge1}(-1)^na_n$条件收敛。说明绝对可和扰动为何不破坏交错级数的收敛。"}
