{"id": "draft-c10-04", "record_sha256": "a03bb1cb99e0efecd128bdaa85a67de2561e7aaeeabb6f60fdb26c6964143d6a", "math_sha256": "8a9670bd314504f0252327f115be9c7144aa6e742d97d2a5a591fca3a2d168d1", "problem": "对$S=\\sum_{n\\ge1}(-1)^{n-1}/3^n$，求精确余项$R_N=S-S_N$；求使实际误差严格小于$1/2500$的最小$N$，再求只使用莱布尼茨界即可保证该条件的最小$N$。"}
{"id": "draft-c10-05", "record_sha256": "e59fc902c5c69e5c05477ec24409b60d026bee0283c1849d7610521adea44105", "math_sha256": "b8291ccf6acb6544efd7f06a5eae6a554e4ef0960558afe6f49f9f4d952c7d66", "problem": "证明莱布尼茨判别法:若 $a_n$ 单调递减趋于 $0$,则交错级数 $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}(-1)^{n+1}a_n$ 收敛,且其和 $S$ 满足 $|S-S_N|\\le a_{N+1}$。"}
